  "[Description]1200kg of fuel. Automatically detaches when empty.": "1200kg 燃油。耗尽后自动脱离。",
  "[Description]2000kg of fuel. Automatically detaches when empty.": "2000kg 燃油。燃料耗尽后自动脱落。",
  "[Description]450kg of fuel. Automatically detaches when empty.": "450kg 燃油。空油后自动脱落。",
  "[Description]A 127mm electromagnetic pulse railgun able to destroy hardened structures at range. Unguided, so shot convergence may vary.": "一门 127mm 电磁脉冲轨道炮，能在远距离摧毁加固工事。无制导，因此弹着散布可能偏大。",
  "[Description]A large anti-surface bomb granted extended range with an unpowered glide kit and INS guidance, able to destroy multiple hardened structures in a single hit.": "一枚大型反舰炸弹，凭借无动力滑翔组件与 INS 制导获得更远射程，可一击摧毁多个加固工事。",
  "[Description]A short-range air-to-air missile with an imaging infrared seeker. Its high-agility airframe and heavy flare rejection allow close-in dogfight engagements against maneuvering targets. Rocket motor performance mirrors the AAM-29 Scythe.": "一种采用成像红外导引头的短程空空导弹。弹体机动性极高、抗干扰弹能力强，可在近距缠斗中对抗机动目标。火箭发动机性能与 AAM-29 镰刀相当。",
  "[Description]A single, and rather large, 50-ton ammo container. When placed on the ground, allows weapon rearmament for units within 200m. Avoid subjecting the containers to large impact forces, as they may detonate.": "单个相当庞大的 50 吨弹药集装箱。放置到地面后，可让 200m 范围内的单位重新装弹。切勿让集装箱承受大的冲击力，否则可能引爆。",
  "[Description]Advanced and flare-resistant medium range infrared air to air missile effective at ranges up to 20km.": "先进抗干扰中程红外空空导弹，有效射程可达 20km。",
  "[Description]An air-deployable Fire Control system for improving the targeting of air defence batteries.": "可空投的火控系统，用于提升防空炮组的瞄准精度。",
  "[Description]An air-transportable R-9 StratoLance launcher, tailored specifically for the cargo bay of the MC-260 Chimera. Links to nearby Radars and Fire Control systems to lock down large areas of airspace.": "可空运的 R-9 平流层之矛发射车，专为 MC-260 奇美拉的货舱定制。可与附近的雷达和火控系统联动，封锁大范围空域。",
  "[Description]An air-transportable RAM-45 SAM turret. Stows six missiles, can be resupplied by containers and deploys after landing. Requires a Radar": "可空运的 RAM-45 防空导弹炮塔。可收纳六枚导弹，能用集装箱补给，着陆后展开。需要",
  "[Description]Aryx Dynamics' largest aircraft so far, the MC-260 Chimera is a versatile heavy cargo aircraft designed for rugged heavy multirole austere operations in frontline areas. It offers short takeoff and landing performance at low load thanks to its blown wing configuration and thrust reversers, and fits in existing medium hangars due to its unique split-drag rudder and ventral strake setup. Chimera can operate as a gunship, a bomber, an AEW and a cargo transport.": "MC-260 奇美拉是 Aryx Dynamics 迄今最大的飞机，一款多用途重型运输机，为前沿地区的艰苦重型多任务环境而设计。凭借吹气增升机翼与反推装置，它在轻载时具备短距起降能力；独特的双片式减速舵与腹鳍布局又让它能塞进现有的中型机库。奇美拉可充当炮艇机、轰炸机、预警机或运输机。",
  "[Description]Conceived at the turn of the century, the FS-3 Ternion is a large, twin-engine multirole fighter. Initially developed for long-endurance patrols over the Pacific, it was later adapted to meet expanding operational demands. Despite lacking stealth characteristics, frequent upgrade packages have allowed the Ternion to continue serving as a reliable defender of the Heartland.": "FS-3 多面手构思于世纪之交，是一款双发大型多用途战斗机。最初为太平洋上空的长时间巡逻而研制，后来经过改装以满足不断扩大的作战需求。尽管不具备隐身特性，频繁的升级套件让「多面手」至今仍是腹地可靠的守卫者。",
  "[Description]Detachable aircraft external fuel tank containing": "可拆卸的机外副油箱，内含",
  "[Description]Directional offensive jammer, capable of blinding one targeted radar per pod at ranges of up to 50km.": "定向进攻性干扰吊舱，每个吊舱可在最远 50km 处致盲一部被锁定的雷达。",
  "[Description]Does not have a parachute, must be dropped on or near ground level.": "无降落伞，必须在地面或接近地面的高度投放。",
  "[Description]Externally-mounted IR countermeasure dispenser for improving survivability": "外挂式红外对抗投放器，用于提高生存性。",
  "[Description]Featuring a unique 3-post ducted thrust system, this trainer doubles as an affordable attack aircraft with VTOL capability. The Vagrant is highly maneuverable and capable of transonic speeds, while also featuring a radar to allow engagement of air targets at beyond visual range. Although lacking advanced stealth features, the VT-7 continues to serve as the backbone of BDF naval aviation.": "这款教练机采用独特的三柱涵道推力系统，兼具低成本攻击机角色并具备垂直起降能力。「流浪者」机动性出色，可达跨音速，还装有雷达，能够超视距交战空中目标。尽管缺乏先进隐身特性，VT-7 至今仍是 BDF 海军航空兵的骨干。",
  "[Description]HLT-R or Radar Station": "HLT-R 或雷达站",
  "[Description]High energy laser weapon designed to intercept missiles and bombs at ranges of up to 15km.": "高能激光武器，用于在最远 15km 处拦截导弹和炸弹。",
  "[Description]Light": "轻型",
  "[Description]Long-range aircraft howitzer firing guided HE rounds.": "机载远程榴弹炮，发射制导高爆弹。",
  "[Description]Long-range anti-ship missile. Sea-skimming cruise with Mach 3 terminal dash.": "远程反舰导弹。掠海巡航，末段 3 马赫冲刺。",
  "[Description]Owing to shortcomings in practical use of the AGM-99 as an anti-ship weapon, this Boscali cruise missile boasts Mach 2.5 cruise speeds and a hefty 700kg warhead supported by a datalinked optical imaging seeker in order to take out heavily defended ships and structures. Nemesis stores 32 IR flares that dispense to defend it against incoming IR missiles.": "由于 AGM-99 在反舰使用中表现不佳，这款波斯卡利巡航导弹以 2.5 马赫的巡航速度与 700kg 的重型战斗部见长，并配备可数据链传输的光学成像导引头，用以清除防御严密的舰船与工事。「复仇女神」内置 32 枚干扰弹，可在遭到红外导弹来袭时释放自保。",
  "[Description]Proposed in the late 2040s as an upgrade and overhaul package for the export-model F-22C in the midst of the Third World War, the F-22E Strike Raptor takes the familiar F-22 aeroform and introduces a pair of midfuselage-chine EOTS for guiding precision-guided munitions, as well as a deepened and expanded weapon bay for carriage of large volumes of ordinance. Excellent agility, thrust vectoring, able to equip stealth weapon pods on its inner wing pylons, and now well-capable of ground attack as well as air dominance, the F-22E is just as fierce as its original design was half a century prior.": "F-22E 打击猛禽于 2040 年代末第三次世界大战期间立项，是出口型 F-22C 的升级大改方案。它沿用人们熟悉的 F-22 气动外形，在机身中部两侧新增一对舷侧 EOTS 以引导精确制导弹药，并加深加宽了武器舱以容纳大量弹药。机动性出色、配备推力矢量，机翼内侧挂架可挂载隐身武器吊舱，如今既保持制空优势、又具备强大的对地打击能力——半个世纪前的原初设计有多凶悍，它如今依旧有多凶悍。",
  "[Description]Support vehicle with a slimmed down container for stowage in tactical airlifters, able to resupply other units": "支援车辆，采用缩窄的集装箱以便装入战术运输机，可为其他单位提供补给。",
  "[Description]The AAM-45 Sabre is a two-stage booster & ramjet, active-radar homing air-to-air missile designed to destroy high value targets from long range, built for carriage within the FS-41 Eclipse. This gigantic half-ton missile combines mach 4 closing speeds and home-on-jam with long range datalinked guidance with a short pitbull distance to oppress if not destroy enemy bombers and large fighters. It is less agile than its peers but packs a devastating punch.": "AAM-45 军刀是一种「两级助推 + 冲压发动机」的主动雷达制导空空导弹，为装入 FS-41 日蚀的弹舱而设计，用于从远距离摧毁高价值目标。这枚半吨重的巨型导弹兼具 4 马赫接近速度与干扰源寻的能力，由数据链提供远程中段制导、主动导引头开机距离极短，足以压制乃至摧毁敌方轰炸机与大型战斗机。它的机动性不及同侪，但一击足以致命。",
  "[Description]The AGM-27 Pyre is a compact air-to-ground missile designed to provide high-end supersonic aircraft with short-range anti-armour capability. It is comparable to the AGM-48 in stature and capability, however is much better suited for high speed aircraft and can be carried internally.": "AGM-27 烈焰是一款紧凑型空地导弹，旨在为高端超音速飞机提供近程反装甲能力。其体量与能力可与 AGM-48 相比，但更适合高速飞机，且可内置携带。",
  "[Description]The ASD-16 Aerial Submunitions Dispenser is a compact, self-contained bomblet dispenser used for area denial and saturation attacks. It utilises a similar model to the GS-25 bomblets found in the GBM-500LR albeit without automatic independent targeting.": "ASD-16 航空子母弹撒布器是一种紧凑的独立式子弹药撒布器，用于区域封锁和饱和攻击。它采用与 GBM-500LR 上 GS-25 子弹药相似的型号，只是不具备自动独立瞄准能力。",
  "[Description]The Alkyon AB-4 is an advanced supersonic bomber with electronic warfare capabilities, designed to stealthily deliver nuclear or conventional payloads onto high value targets. 4 afterburning engines combined with variable geometry wings provide incredible top speed and enough maneuverability to evade aerial threats. If critically damaged, a crew escape capsule allows for safe ejection at any altitude or airspeed.": "阿尔基翁 AB-4 是一款具备电子战能力的先进超音速轰炸机，可隐蔽地将核或常规载荷投送至高价值目标。4 台加力发动机配合可变后掠翼，带来惊人的极速与足以规避空中威胁的机动性。若遭受致命损伤，乘员逃逸舱可在任意高度与速度下安全弹射。",
  "[Description]The Combat Reconnaissance Vehicle": "战斗侦察车",
  "[Description]The FS-41 Eclipse is a large twin-engine supersonic carrier-based interceptor aircraft designed to locate, intercept and destroy high value targets before they can threaten allied airspace and carrier groups. It combines mach 2+ speeds, an extraordinarily powerful radar and impressive stealth characteristics for its role of interception and oppression, bolstered by its signature AAM-45 Sabre armament. It is additionally highly agile thanks to its variable geometry wings and can carry limited air to ground stores for multi-mission capability.": "FS-41 日蚀是一种大型双发超音速舰载拦截机，用于在高价值目标威胁友方空域与航母编队之前发现、拦截并摧毁它们。它以 2 马赫以上的速度、异常强大的雷达和出色的隐身特性胜任拦截与压制职责，招牌武器正是 AAM-45 军刀。得益于变后掠翼，它的机动性同样出色，还可携带有限的对地弹药以执行多任务。",
  "[Description]The J-50 is a sixth-generation twin-engine air-superiority fighter, featuring a tailless delta planform, swing wings, and an internal weapons bay for long-range missiles.": "J-50 是一种第六代双发制空战斗机，采用无尾三角翼布局与变后掠翼，并设内置武器舱用于携带远程导弹。",
  "[Description]The Type-12 CEV is a combat engineering vehicle built on an up-armoured Type-12 chassis. It operates at higher efficiency than the unmanned M12 Jackknife and sports a 12.7mm machine gun for self-defence.": "Type-12 CEV 是一款基于强化装甲 Type-12 底盘打造的装甲工程车。其作业效率高于无人的 M12 折叠刀，并装有 12.7mm 机枪用于自卫。",
  "[Description]This anti-ship missile has a very low altitude cruise profile with a pop-up terminal attack mode designed to penetrate ship defenses. Can be deployed from aircraft or launched from an Argus Class Frigate.": "这款反舰导弹采用极低空巡航弹道，末段以跃升攻击模式突防，旨在穿透舰艇防御。可由飞机投放，或从阿尔戈斯级护卫舰上发射。",
  "[Description]This rotary cannon fires high explosive 20mm rounds at 1,200rpm, excellent for close-in air to air engagements. This option has a lower fire rate than the standard 20mm for increased endurance at the cost of shot volume.": "该转管炮以 1200rpm 发射 20mm 高爆弹，非常适合近距空战。此选项射速低于标准 20mm 型，以牺牲弹药投送量为代价换取更长的持续作战时间。",
  "[Description]This rotary cannon fires high explosive 20mm rounds at 5,000rpm, excellent for close-in air to air engagements.": "该转管炮以 5000rpm 发射 20mm 高爆弹，非常适合近距空战。",
  "[Description]This stealthy, optically-guided glide bomb packs a heavy punch with its unitary 400kg HE warhead, and is detected at a shorter range compared to other glide munitions.": "这款隐身光学制导滑翔炸弹凭借单枚 400kg 高爆战斗部威力十足，且相比其他滑翔弹药更难被远距发现。",
  "[Description]This twin-barrel 30mm swivel gunpod fires 30mm AP shells effective against armoured vehicles and buildings.": "这门双管 30mm 可旋转机炮吊舱发射 30mm 穿甲弹，对装甲车辆与建筑有效。",
  "[Description]for targeting.": "来提供目标指示。",
